 "differences": [
  "The paper reports a baseline MDS-UPDRS total (parts I-III) of 43.64 (SD 8.23, range 34-59); the export's parts I, II and III add to 42.64 (SD 7.78, range 34-57), so that one number does not reproduce. The improvements of the group-mean MDS-UPDRS III are 22.54, 40.75 and 52.89 percent here against 22.5, 40.75 and 52.98 in the paper.",
  "The paper says the task stopped after block 9 of 10 in one participant's LDR session; in the deposit the one session with 9 blocks is the baseline session (a) of the participant who did not consent to retention, so it is not in this file.",
  "The deposit lists no license (the paper itself is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0); the data are shared with credit to the authors and removed on request.",
  "Rows cover 10 of the paper's 11 participants (one did not agree to data retention); the paper's counts and clinical numbers were reproduced on all 11 from the authors' clinical export."
 ],
